    "text": "Ic bidde eow & eadmodlice l\u00e6re, men \u00fea l\u00e6ofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge wepen on \u00feisse medmiclan tide for eowrum\nHer gehyr\u00f0 Drihten \u00fea \u00fee hine bidda\u00f0 & him sylle\u00f0 heora synna forgyfnessa.\nHer he is swi\u00f0e forebyrdig ofer us ac he is \u00fe\u00e6r swi\u00f0e re\u00f0e.\nHer is his mildheortnes ofer us ac \u00fe\u00e6r is se eca dom.\nHer is seo l\u00e6nlice winsumnes ac \u00fe\u00e6r is seo syngale nearones.\nHer synt \u00feisse weorolde wynlustas ac \u00fe\u00e6r synt \u00fea ecan tintregu.\nHer is hlehter ac \u00fe\u00e6r is se ungeendoda heaf.\n\u00d0\u00e6r beo\u00f0 \u00feonne ure hr\u00e6gla fretwodnes on \u00feam ecan fyre widnode.\nHer is ures modes upahafennes ac \u00fe\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feystro dymnes.\nOngyta\u00f0 nu \u00feas, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00fee eow towearde synt & symble beo gesorhfulle for eowre sawle\nWepa\u00f0 on \u00feisse worulde \u00fe\u00e6t ge ne \u00feurfen eft wepan \u00feone ungeendedan wop.\nGeeadmeda\u00f0 eow her \u00fe\u00e6t ge ne syn \u00fe\u00e6r geni\u00f0rade & \u00fe\u00e6t ge ne syn sende on \u00fea ytemestan \u00feistro & on\nEala man \u00fea leofestan, hwa is \u00e6fre swa heardre heortan \u00fe\u00e6t he ne m\u00e6ge wepan \u00fea toweardan witu &\nHw\u00e6t is us la selre on \u00feisse weorolde \u00feonne we symble ure synna hreowe don & hi mid \u00e6lmessan\nNe m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feonne gefultmian se f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6m suna ne se suna \u00fe\u00e6m f\u00e6der ac sceal \u00feonne anra gehwilc\nEala, \u00feu man, hw\u00e6t dest \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ne sy \u00feam dumban nytene gelic?\nGe\u00feenc & ongyt hu micel gedal God betweox us gesceop.\nHe sende on \u00fea sawle andgyt \u00fe\u00e6t nafa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t nyten.\nEala \u00feu man, waca & gebide & miltsa \u00fee \u00fea hwile \u00fee \u00feu m\u00e6ge.\nGemun \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten for \u00fee of \u00fe\u00e6m hean heofone on \u00feas neowlan gesceaft ni\u00f0erastah t