nSeo earme sawel hig \u00fea w\u00e6s behealdende & heo ongan earmlice cleopian & cw\u00e6\u00f0, wa me earmre, to\nHeo \u00fea locade to hyre lichoman & cw\u00e6\u00f0, wa \u00fee \u00feu, earma lichoma, \u00feu \u00fee w\u00e6re nimende fremdra\nEala \u00feu earma, nu \u00feu byst geworden \u00fe\u00e6t fuleste hreaw & wyrma mete.\n\u00deu rest \u00fee nu medmicle tid on eor\u00f0an & ic mid sare & geomurunge to helle sceal beon l\u00e6ded.\nSe lichoma \u00fea ongan \u00fea swi\u00f0e sw\u00e6tan & mislic hiw bredan.\n\u00de\u00e6t deofol ongan \u00fea cleopian & cw\u00e6\u00f0, stinga\u00f0 hyne mid sare on his eagan for\u00fean eal swa hw\u00e6t swa he\nStinga\u00f0 hyne mid sare on his mu\u00f0 for\u00feon eal swa hw\u00e6t swa hyne lyste etan o\u00f0\u00f0e drincan o\u00f0\u00f0e sprecan\nStinga\u00f0 hyne mid sare on his heortan for\u00feon \u00fee on hyre ne wunode arf\u00e6stnis ne mildheortnes ne Godes\nHig genaman \u00fea \u00fea earman sawle mid micle sare & geomorunge & hi asettan ofer hyre \u00fea sweartestan\nHeo axode \u00fea deoflu, hw\u00e6t seo beorohtnysse w\u00e6re?\nHig hyre andwyrden & cw\u00e6den, ne ongytst \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t hit is heofona rices gefea \u00feanon \u00feu w\u00e6re\nNu \u00feu f\u00e6rst \u00feurh \u00fea f\u00e6gerestan & \u00fea beorhtestan wununga ac \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6r ne most wunian.\nNu \u00feu gehyrst engla \u00fereatas & \u00feu gesyhst eallra haligra beorohtnessa & swa\u00feeah \u00fee nis lyfed \u00fe\u00e6r to\nSeo earme sawl \u00fea ongan mid micelre sare & wope heofian & cw\u00e6\u00f0, wa me \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00e6fre swa earm\n\u00d0a deoflu hig \u00fea gel\u00e6ddan & wepende & geomrigende hy sealdon suman fyrenan dracan se ontynde\nIc eow \u00feonne bidde, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feonne \u00feis on bysne asettan, \u00feeah we \u00feillico wito witan\nAc us gedafena\u00f0 mid micelre ea\u00f0modnysse gyrnan to \u00feam ecean gefean \u00fe\u00e6r nis dea\u00f0es ege ne deofles\n\u00de\u